  jersey/model.py   the "PARSeq-Tiny" section: the encoder, decoder layer and weight initialisation,
                    kept as written there except: the tokenizer-driven decoding loop is replaced by
                    ParseqDecoder.read(), and named_apply is defined locally.

The released PARSeq-Tiny weights (parseq_tiny-e7a21b54.pt, PARSeq release v1.0.0) are downloaded at
training time and fine-tuned here; the fine-tuned weights are shipped in weights/final/best.pt.

